      "text": "[6:55AM]  #Island\n#Marina\n#TrafficUpdate\nAn appreciable movement all the way from UBA roundabout and NNPC filling station towards Cathedral church and Nitel intersection.\n State House connecting Force road is looking good.\n\nPerfect movement from Onikan roundabout towards TBS, Water board and  connecting Nitel intersection.\n\nThe entire stretch of Broad Street and Igbosere road is free.\n\nWhile movement from Catholic mission Street connecting Ganiu Smith Street Inward Gbamgose Street down to Tinubu Street is good as well.\nFree flow of Traffic from Zone 2 underneath bridge towards Flag staff House connecting MCewen bridge.\n#FollowLASTMA",
